; F461 actuator / fan coil / setpoint flow (OpenWebNet-HA/MyHOME#792 review, section 3):
; all-zones and Z#0 actuator requests, the season-gated fan speed, the humidity
; probe, a setpoint write above the measured 24.9 that switches the heating valve
; on and the restore to 24.5 that switches it off; then the same requests in
; cooling season (fan speed answered), the return to heating with the manual
; heating write *#4*2*#14*0245*1## (the generic function 3 write that follows
; keeps the season, see below) and the actuator poll.
