; Season and the generic write, after the live F461 2.0.11 bench of 2026-10-26
; (reports/data/live_scan_confirm_2026-10-26, zone 2 at 23.9-24.0): a cooling
; write with the room below the target switched the season (*4*0*2##) with no
; demand (*#4*2*19*5*0##, actuator 1 off, fan coil 5), and the generic write
; *#4*2*#14*T*3## that followed left the zone in cooling with no season event;
; the mode byte of dimensions 12 and 14 stayed 3 throughout. The plant's room is
; 24.9, so the no-demand cooling write here is 26.0.
